description:
The purpose of this Call for Tenders is to award Framework Agreements to up to 5 successful Tenderers (per each lot) for the provision of consultants and specific information security services to support the Cybersecurity Division of the Group Digital Office of the European Investment Bank. The services in scope include:
Lot 1, Provision of IT Security Operations Consultancy Services;
Lot 2, Provision of Business Continuity Consultancy Services; 
Lot 3, Provision of Information Protection and Identity and Access Management Consultancy Services; and
Lot 4, Provision of IT Security Testing Services.

