description:
The scope of this call for tenders is the provision of the following EDM services: 
•	Provision of support to the current ENOVIA SMARTEAM environment deployed at Fusion for Energy, until it’s completely replaced by the new tool. 
•	Execution of project for replacing ENOVIA SMARTEAM by a new EDM tool, including: 
•	Consultancy for the assessment and improvement of the integrated engineering processes for technical data management at F4E, mainly CAD, CAE and Metrology data; 
•	Consultancy for the selection of a new tool to replace ENOVIA SMARTEAM based on defined requirements;
•	Management the deployment, configuration and maintenance of the new tool replacing ENOVIA SMARTEAM once the tool is selected; 
•	Management the migration of data stored in ENOVIA SMARTEAM and its customizations to the new tool. 
•	Training, knowledge transfer and support on the new tool.

